t_id":"68c94ebce53de9418257b095","name":"raoliang_sac","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/raoliang_sac"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":167682265,"discussion_id":"a71db69234d587b862ae1fe6bc1ce52579283520","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR包含两项针对华为昇腾AI处理器算子内核代码的修改。第一项修改修复了KV RMSNorm RoPE缓存操作内核中一个潜在的类型转换溢出风险，通过启用饱和模式确保从32位浮点数到16位整数的转换结果被正确钳位在目标数据类型的有效范围内，从而提升数值计算的稳定性和精度。第二项修改是对控制溢出模式的宏定义和变量名进行重构，旨在提升代码的可读性和一致性。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n具体修改包含两部分：1. 在`kv_rms_norm_rope_cache_regbase_base.h`头文件中，将`CAST_FP32_TO_INT16`转换特征的饱和模式（`SatMode`）从`NO_SAT`改为`SAT`，以防御性地处理转换溢出。2. 将宏定义`FLOAT_OVERFLOW_MODE_CTRL`重命名为`GLOBAL_OVERFLOW_MODE_CTRL`，并将其关联的局部变量`oriOverflowMode`相应重命名为`globalOriOverflowMode`。两项修改均不涉及核心算法或功能逻辑变更，前者属于安全增强，后者属于代码风格优化。","created_at":"2026-04-08T16:38:13+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-08T16:38:13+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":167682486,"discussion_id":"bbb5f41e8a7a2957adbebfce03585b8fccb49521","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=3537b826c3c54622a4fd365051123f9e&pipelineRunId=23037c6ab3ee4599946ce509051bce78&projectName=CANN'>23037c6ab3ee4599946ce509051bce78</a></b>][<b><a href='https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/ci/ci_guide.md'>流水线指导</a></b>]\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse\"><tr><th>任务名称</th><th>状态</th><th>日志</th><th>下载链接</th></tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>Compile_Ascend_X86</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=3537b826c3c54622a4fd365051123f9e&pipelineRunId=23037c6ab3ee4599946ce509051bce78&projectName=CANN>>>>>></a></td>\n               